---
title: "Fig 2.4a — Authentification Email/Password"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor       User        as Utilisateur
    participant FE          as Next.js Frontend
    participant NA          as NextAuth.js
    participant BE          as NestJS API
    participant DB          as PostgreSQL
    participant GH          as GitHub OAuth
    participant JW          as JWT Service

    User->>FE: Soumet formulaire (email, password)
    FE->>NA: signIn("credentials", { email, password })

    activate NA
    NA->>BE: POST /auth/login { email, password }
    activate BE

    BE->>DB: SELECT * FROM User WHERE email = ?
    activate DB
    DB-->>BE: User record (hash inclus)
    deactivate DB

    alt Utilisateur introuvable
        BE-->>NA: 401 Unauthorized
        NA-->>FE: error: "CredentialsSignin"
        FE-->>User: ❌ Email ou mot de passe incorrect
    else Password invalide (bcrypt.compare échoue)
        BE-->>NA: 401 Unauthorized
        NA-->>FE: error: "CredentialsSignin"
        FE-->>User: ❌ Email ou mot de passe incorrect
    else Authentification réussie
        BE->>JW: signAccessToken(userId, email, roles)
        BE->>JW: signRefreshToken(userId)
        activate JW
        JW-->>BE: { accessToken, refreshToken }
        deactivate JW

        BE-->>NA: 200 OK { accessToken, refreshToken, user }
        deactivate BE

        NA->>NA: jwt() callback — stocke tokens dans le token JWT chiffré
        NA-->>FE: Session établie { user, accessToken }
        deactivate NA
        FE-->>User: ✅ Redirige vers /dashboard
    end
